(b) joint rebuilt from the four larger-context numbers, worst abs error: 3.33e-16
(c) marginals P(X=1)=0.3, P(Y=1)=0.6 fixed; larger-context numbers [P(Y=1|X=0), P(Y=1|X=1), P(X=1|Y=0), P(X=1|Y=1)] as the one free number t moves:
    t=0.001  [0.856, 0.003, 0.747, 0.002]
